        {
            "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
            "body": "Okay, my original statement was indeed fake news, I did not see the `Keyboard interrupt` error in v0.8.0 due to some refactors being made in commit 565f72b9689e0c440ff72c712a090224aaf7631b fixing this issue specifically with the function `nvim_buf_get_mark`, but replacing it with a function from Vimscript such as `vim.fn.getpos('.')` made the bug reappear. However, investigating further, with a modified repro, I discovered that this bug was actually fixed in the commit 6bf2a6fc5bb395b67c88cb26d332f882a106c7ab, which made it into v0.11.0. So I think this issue can be officially declared solved.",
